{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"options":{"content":"","images":{},"widgets":{}},"periodicTable":false,"type":"multiple"},"hints":[{"content":"We can play around with the expressions in the answer choices to see if they are the same as $-6n+(-12)+4n$.","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's see if the first expression is equivalent to $-6n+(-12)+4n$.\n\n$\\qquad\n\\begin{align}\n\\\\\\\\\n{4(n-3) -6n}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -6n+(-12)+4n  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{4(n-3) -6n}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -2n+(-12)   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{4(n-3) -6n}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -2n-12   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{(4)n-(4)3 -6n}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}-2n-12   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{4n-12 -6n}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -2n-12    \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-2n-12}   \u0026= -2n-12 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n \\end{align}$","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's see if the second expression is equivalent to $-6n+(-12)+4n$.\n\n$\\qquad\n\\begin{align}\n\\\\\\\\\n{2(2n-6)}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -6n+(-12)+4n  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{2(2n-6)}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -2n+(-12)   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{2(2n-6)}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -2n-12 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{(2)2n-(2)6}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -2n-12 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{4n-12}   \u0026\\ne -2n-12\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n \\end{align}$","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expression is equivalent to $-6n+(-12)+4n$ :\n\n\n-  ${4(n-3) -6n} $\n","images":{},"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Which expressions are equivalent to $-6n+(-12)+4n$ ?**  \n\n[[☃ radio 1]]\n\n","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$4(n-3) -6n$","correct":true},{"content":"$2(2n-6)$","correct":false},{"isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"onePerLine":true,"randomize":false},"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
